# Local agent rules

1. Read `AGENTS.md` and `PROJECT.md` before non-trivial work
2. Read `memory/working.md` at session start
3. Long runs: follow `docs/agent/LONGEVITY.md` + `FAILURE_RECOVERY.md` + `HARDWARE_LOCAL.md`
4. Web: `docs/agent/WEB.md` + recipes; Unreal: `unreal/00_INDEX.md` + `BRIDGE_LIMITS.md` + recipes
5. One queue item per turn; status must include memory updated / task / retries / next
6. Recipe -> patch -> verify; keep Unreal graphs editable
7. Bridge no/partial or mutation gated: never fake PIE/writes
8. On failure: gist -> fix -> retry (max 3) -> continue or block
9. No invented scope; no secrets; human owns architecture, merge, deploy, PIE/visual
